/* 夜色琥珀：近黑底、米白字、只有一個強調色（琥珀）。方角，靠留白和細線分層，不用卡片套卡片。 */
page {
  --void: #07070b;
  --panel: #111219;
  --line: #22242d;
  --text: #f4efe5;
  --soft: #bdb8ae;
  --mute: #807c75;
  --ember: #ffb56b;
  --ember-ink: #1c1206;
  --ember-dim: rgba(255, 181, 107, 0.14);
  --danger: #c2412b;
  background: var(--void);
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "PingFang TC", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
}

.wrap { padding: 0 32rpx; box-sizing: border-box; }
.muted { color: var(--mute); font-size: 24rpx; }
.soft { color: var(--soft); }
.num-font { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }

.section-label { color: var(--soft); font-size: 26rpx; margin: 44rpx 0 16rpx; }

.btn {
  background: var(--ember);
  color: var(--ember-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 84rpx;
  text-align: center;
  transition: transform 0.12s ease-out, opacity 0.12s ease-out;
}

/* 按下去的回饋：用微信原生的 hover-class，手指一碰就有反應 */
.press { transform: scale(0.97); opacity: 0.82; }
.press-row { background: #101018 !important; }
.press-link { opacity: 0.5; }
.link-btn { display: inline-block; padding: 16rpx 24rpx; }

/* 第一次出現：由下往上淡入，列表依序錯開一點點 */
.enter { animation: enter 0.42s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both; }
@keyframes enter { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20rpx); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
.btn.ghost { background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1rpx solid var(--line); font-weight: 400; }
.btn.off { opacity: 0.4; }

.input {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  height: 84rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
.ph { color: #5d5a55; }

.banner { padding: 18rpx 32rpx; font-size: 24rpx; color: var(--soft); border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line); }
.banner.warn { color: var(--ember); }
.banner.err { color: #ff8a73; }

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2rpx 14rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  color: var(--soft);
}
.tag.on { border-color: var(--ember); color: var(--ember); }
.tag.fill { background: var(--ember); border-color: var(--ember); color: var(--ember-ink); }
.tag.done { opacity: 0.4; text-decoration: line-through; }

/* 招牌動效：監控中＝慢慢轉的小吸積盤；暫停時停住變暗 */
.disk { width: 40rpx; height: 40rpx; position: relative; flex: none; }
.disk .ring {
  position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(255, 181, 107, 0.18);
  border-top-color: var(--ember);
  border-right-color: rgba(255, 181, 107, 0.55);
  animation: spin 3.2s linear infinite;
}
.disk .core { position: absolute; left: 12rpx; top: 12rpx; width: 16rpx; height: 16rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #020205; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2rpx rgba(255, 181, 107, 0.25); }
.disk.off .ring { animation-play-state: paused; border-color: #3a3b45; }
.disk.off .core { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2rpx #3a3b45; }
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

/* 自訂開關：原生 switch 關掉時在深色底上只剩一顆白點，看不出是開關 */
.toggle {
  width: 96rpx; height: 56rpx; flex: none; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box;
  border-radius: 28rpx; background: #2a2b34; border: 1rpx solid #3a3b45;
  transition: background 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease;
}
.toggle .knob {
  position: absolute; left: 6rpx; top: 5rpx; width: 44rpx; height: 44rpx; border-radius: 50%;
  background: #9a958c; transition: transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), background 0.22s ease;
}
.toggle.on { background: var(--ember); border-color: var(--ember); }
.toggle.on .knob { transform: translateX(38rpx); background: var(--ember-ink); }
.toggle.busy { opacity: 0.5; }

/* 大號碼的字體：有載到展示字體就用它，沒有就用系統裡最接近的窄體 */
.display-font { font-family: "LiveNum", "Avenir Next Condensed", "DIN Alternate", "Roboto Condensed", -apple-system, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }

/* 換號碼：舊號碼往上飛走、新號碼從下面頂上來（翻頁鐘）。這是整個 App 的招牌時刻。 */
.big-wrap { position: relative; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; }
.flip-out { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; animation: flipOut 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) both; }
.flip-in { animation: flipIn 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both; }
@keyframes flipOut { from { transform: none; opacity: 1; } to { transform: translateY(-100%); opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes flipIn { from { transform: translateY(100%); opacity: 0; } 40% { opacity: 1; } to { transform: none; opacity: 1; } }
